[99C[4A[?25h]0;⠂ mini-worker[?25l[99D[4B[11A[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mYou are a leaf executor. Do the work yourself — do NOT re-delegate.[39m                                                                                                                                   [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B  [38;2;255;255;255m## Task: Fix hardcoded Python/IKB path fallbacks for k8s portability[39m                                                                                                                                  [1B  [38;2;255;255;255mGitLab issue: project-b#00146[39m                                                                                                                                                                         [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B  [38;2;255;255;255m## Background[39m                                                                                                                                                                                         [1B  [38;2;255;255;255mnexus runs both on host (dev) and in k8s pods. On host, HOME=/data/user01; in pods, HOME=/data/coder (or similar). Hardcoded ~/.pyver paths silently resolve to wrong locations in containers. We [39m    [1B  [38;2;255;255;255mneed loud failures in k8s rather than silent wrong-path fallbacks.[39m                                                                                                                                    [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B  [38;2;255;255;255m## Files to change[39m                                                                                                                                                                                    [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255m### 1. code/core/nexus_core/goal_listener.py — around line 111-113[39m                                                                                                                                    [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255mCurrently has a fallback that builds a path like:[39m                                                                                                                                                     [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255m  `Path.home() / ".pyver/versions/miniconda3-latest/bin/python"`[39m                                                                                                                                      [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m                                                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255mChange logic to:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255m- Check env-vars `PYTHON_BIN` or `PY_PATH` first (existing behavior)[39m                                                                                                                                  [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255m- If neither is set AND `KUBERNETES_SERVICE_HOST` env-var is present → raise RuntimeError with message: "PYTHON_BIN env-var required in k8s (no ~/.pyver fallback in containers)"[39m                     [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255m- If neither is set AND not in k8s → keep existing pyenv fallback (host behavior unchanged)[39m                                                                                                           [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m                                                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255m### 2. code/core/mcp/agent_delegator/utils.py — around line 100 and 102[39m                                                                                                                               [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255mLine ~100: same pyenv python path fallback[39m                                                                                                                                                            [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255mLine ~102: `~/gitRepos/intelligent_kb` IKB path fallback[39m                                                                                                                                              [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m                                                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255mApply the same pattern for each:[39m                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255m- Env-var checked first (`PY_PATH`/`PYTHON_BIN` for python, `IKB_ROOT` for IKB path)[39m                                                                                                                  [49m
[48;2;55;55;55m  [38;2;255;255;255m- If not set AND in k8s → raise RuntimeError with descriptive message naming the required env-var[39m                                                                                                     [49m
